  "notes": "An RS485 (Modbus RTU) meter: reach it through a Modbus TCP gateway and give that gateway's host and the meter's unit_id (1 unless set otherwise). Every value is a float32 in input registers, most significant register first; a meter set to reversed register order needs byte_order CDAB on its row. Registers cross-checked against the open-source mbmd project (meters/rs485/sdm.go).",
